/*
THE GALLERY HEIST — the mystery, inverted.

Every other case file here asks "who did it?" This one asks "CAN it
be done?" — and the engine referees. The plan is a timeline: wait for
the patrol gap, cross the gallery, lift the gem, get out. The checks
below are the stealth contract, and they gate: tighten a guard's
patrol by two minutes and `check never sees(guard_b thief)` goes red
at the exact instant the plan dies (try it — move guard_b's return
from 2:19 to 2:17). A heist that survives the compiler is a heist
that survives the museum.

Everything on display is load-bearing: the case is GLASS (the gem is
visible to every witness and still honestly inside — seen is not
touched), the lions are animals standing very still, the gem rides
POCKETED after the strike (concealed by the thief's body — a guard
who glimpsed him would still not see the loot), and the camera tells
the whole thing, first person included.
*/

theme noir
clock 2:00 minute(1)
time strike 2:17

room gallery size(11 3.5 6) door(to entrance) color(#3a3d47)
room entrance size(4 3 3) south-of(gallery)
room west_wing size(4 3 4) west-of(gallery) door(to gallery) color(#33363f)
room east_wing size(4 3 4) east-of(gallery) door(to gallery) color(#33363f)
room street size(7 3 3) south-of(entrance) walls(0) color(#22242c)

room case size(1.1 1.9 1.1) at(gallery 0 -1.5) glass color(#b8d0e0)
box pedestal size(0.4 0.8 0.4) at(case) color(#5a5d66)
sphere gem r(0.16) on(pedestal) color(#3fd0a4)

animal lion_a h(1.1) at(gallery -4 1.6) color(#8a8d94)
animal lion_b h(1.1) at(gallery 4 1.6) color(#8a8d94)

person guard_a at(gallery -3 0) color(#3d4a6b)
person guard_b at(gallery 3 0) color(#3d4a6b)
person thief at(street 0 0) color(#1d1f26)

// the patrol: each guard checks a wing; both are out 2:15-2:19.
// That gap IS the heist — nobody planned it, the schedules just
// happen to overlap, which is how real security fails.
walk guard_a to(west_wing -1 1.2) over(1m) start(2:13)
walk guard_a to(gallery -3 0) over(1m) start(2:20)
walk guard_b to(east_wing 1 1.4) over(1m) start(2:14)
walk guard_b to(gallery 3 0) over(1m) start(2:19)

// the plan
walk thief to(entrance) over(1m) start(2:13)
walk thief to(gallery 0 1.5) over(1m) start(2:15)
walk thief to(case 0 1) over(0.5m)
take thief gem at(strike)
walk thief to(entrance) over(1m) start(2:18)
walk thief to(street) over(1m)

// ---- the stealth contract: these GATE the plan ----------------------
check never sees(guard_a thief)
check never sees(guard_b thief)
check ever carries(thief gem)
check always in(gem case) during(2:00 2:16)

// ---- the derived story ----------------------------------------------
? when in(thief gallery)
? when carries(thief gem)
?- has(thief, gem, T0, T1)

// ---- the telling ----------------------------------------------------
camera to(0 8 13) over(0) look(gallery)
camera to(gallery 0 1.7 2.6) start(2:05) over(4m) ease(in-out) look(case)
camera from(thief) start(2:13)
camera to(6 4 9) start(2:19) over(2m) ease(out) look(case)
